DECISION_032: Phase 10 - Achievements Constants Optimization
Date: March 8, 2026
Status: IMPLEMENTED

Details:
- Added O(1) dictionary lookup functions to achievements/constants.py
- get_achievement_by_id() - cached lookup by achievement ID
- get_achievements_by_category() - cached lookup by category
- get_tier_color() - cached tier color lookup
- get_tier_emoji() - cached tier emoji lookup
- get_category_display() - cached category display name
- get_all_achievement_ids() - cached list of IDs
- get_categories() - cached list of categories
- Pre-built _ACHIEVEMENT_BY_ID and _ACHIEVEMENTS_BY_CATEGORY dicts at module load

Performance Impact:
- Replaces O(n) list iteration with O(1) dict lookup
- @st.cache_data(ttl=3600) prevents recalculation


