DECISION_034: Phase 10 - Field Module Constants Audit Summary
Date: March 8, 2026
Status: COMPLETE

Fields Audited:
1. Habits - Already has caching, batch loading placeholder exists
2. Tasks - Already has caching (@st.cache_data on get_priority_index_map)
3. Goals - Already has caching (@st.cache_data on get_goal_icon_index_map)  
4. Health - Uses dicts (O(1)), no explicit caching needed
5. Finances - Previously optimized with cached lookups
6. Time - Previously optimized with cached lookups
7. Emotional Health - Uses dicts (O(1))
8. Achievements - NEW: Added 7 cached O(1) lookup functions
9. Dashboard - NEW: Added 3 cached functions

Key Findings:
- Most fields already optimized with @st.cache_data decorators
- Habits has a placeholder batch_load function that needs implementation
- N+1 query issue exists in card_view.py where multiple DB calls happen per habit
- Achievements and Dashboard were the main ones needing new optimizations

Next Steps for Further Optimization:
1. Implement actual batch loading in habits/helpers.py (placeholder returns {})
2. Refactor card_view.py to use batch loading to fix N+1 queries
3. Consider adding @st.cache_data to helpers in other fields


